    <briefdescription>
<para>Shard-level integrity record for RAID-Merkle-Proof integration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When an artifact is placed on a shard, a <ref refid="structthemis_1_1llm_1_1lora_1_1_shard_ledger_entry" kindref="compound">ShardLedgerEntry</ref> records the shard assignment alongside the Merkle proof required to verify that the shard fragment is part of the original artifact.</para>
<para>Shard ledger entries are chained via prev_entry_hash so the full history of shard placements for an artifact is tamper-evident. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
